  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to PRONASAR (Government of Mozambique WASH Programme) via Fund Manager - capital expenditure</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supports the Government of Mozambique&#x2019;s (GoM) Rural Water and Sanitation Programme (PRONASAR). PRONASAR is funded by GoM and through a multi-donor Joint Fund mechanism. An FCDO established Fund Manager manages the UK (and other donor) contributions to PRONASAR.</narrative>
  </description>
